#: src/languages/cpp.md:63
msgid ""
"You can pass any number of arguments to clangd. To see a full set of "
"available options, run `clangd --help` from the command line. For example "
"with `--function-arg-placeholders=0` completions contain only parentheses "
"for function calls, while the default (`--function-arg-placeholders=1`) "
"completions also contain placeholders for method parameters."
